{"4940800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Global Plates", "steam_appid": 4940800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5011500], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/52154452bae43a8e946cc83c99d1ee4e.poster.avif?t=1786734942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/52154452bae43a8e946cc83c99d1ee4e.webm?t=1786734942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/52154452bae43a8e946cc83c99d1ee4e.mp4?t=1786734942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cook your way around the world — one factory at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Plates</strong> is a cozy cooking-automation game. Place machines, lay conveyor belts, and turn streams of raw ingredients into the world's most beloved dishes — from a plate of spaghetti in a sunny Italian canal town to sushi, paella, and masala on the far side of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍕 Build Delicious Factories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop dispensers, processors, ovens, and assemblers onto the grid, then connect everything with conveyor belts. Watch dough get kneaded, sauce get simmered, and finished pizzas parade down the line to the delivery counter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥬 Keep It Fresh</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients lose freshness with every belt they ride. Sloppy, sprawling layouts deliver sad, smelly food — tight, clever ones earn you three stars. The worst ingredient drags the whole dish down, so every line matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Travel the World<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/7309f5e6f129136ea671ffb7fd89fe7c.poster.avif?t=1786734942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/7309f5e6f129136ea671ffb7fd89fe7c.webm?t=1786734942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/7309f5e6f129136ea671ffb7fd89fe7c.mp4?t=1786734942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across a hand-drawn travel journal world map: gondola-lined canals, cozy riverside meadows, and new cuisines at every stop. Fill your passport with stamps as you master each region's signature dish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Discover Every Recipe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with machines and ingredients to unlock the full recipe tree in your Discovery Journal. Some combinations aren't on the menu…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Master the Line<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/3125e0735ff7db8198ffd176ed46b672.poster.avif?t=1786734942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/3125e0735ff7db8198ffd176ed46b672.webm?t=1786734942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/3125e0735ff7db8198ffd176ed46b672.mp4?t=1786734942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your best times, chase 3-star freshness ratings, and climb per-level Steam leaderboards where your score is speed × freshness. Relax and build at your own pace — or tear it all down and optimize for the perfect run.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/52154452bae43a8e946cc83c99d1ee4e.poster.avif?t=1786734942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/52154452bae43a8e946cc83c99d1ee4e.webm?t=1786734942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/52154452bae43a8e946cc83c99d1ee4e.mp4?t=1786734942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cook your way around the world — one factory at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Plates</strong> is a cozy cooking-automation game. Place machines, lay conveyor belts, and turn streams of raw ingredients into the world's most beloved dishes — from a plate of spaghetti in a sunny Italian canal town to sushi, paella, and masala on the far side of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍕 Build Delicious Factories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop dispensers, processors, ovens, and assemblers onto the grid, then connect everything with conveyor belts. Watch dough get kneaded, sauce get simmered, and finished pizzas parade down the line to the delivery counter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥬 Keep It Fresh</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients lose freshness with every belt they ride. Sloppy, sprawling layouts deliver sad, smelly food — tight, clever ones earn you three stars. The worst ingredient drags the whole dish down, so every line matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Travel the World<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/7309f5e6f129136ea671ffb7fd89fe7c.poster.avif?t=1786734942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940800/extras/7309f5e6f129136ea671ffb7fd89fe7c.web